# Kairo Language Documentation

The canonical source for Kairo's documentation lives in the [kairo-web](https://github.com/kairolang/kairo-web) repo under `src/content/docs/`. The published docs are at [www.kairolang.org](https://www.kairolang.org).

This directory is a **read-only mirror** and may lag behind the canonical source. Do not submit doc changes here, open PRs against [kairo-web](https://github.com/kairolang/kairo-web) instead.

If you spot a discrepancy between this mirror and the live docs, [open an issue](https://github.com/kairolang/kairo-web/issues/new).